                                                "sense_id": "b13dd2eb-cd2e-393f-98df-0c37a32096eb",
                                                "text": "Her dress is too obviously \"costume,\" and Ford-Smith mugs too broadly for us to forget, as we should, that Katie is a theatrical invention."
